#: gui/common/gamedescription.js:263
msgid ""
"Only one player can win the game. If the remaining players are allies, the "
"game continues until only one remains."
msgstr "Hanya satu pemain dapat memenangkan permainan. Bila pemain-pemain yang tersisa bersekutu, permainan akan tetap berlangsung sampai hanya tersisa satu."

