msgid "Allied Victory"
msgstr "Persekutuan Menang"

#: gui/common/gamedescription.js:268
msgid ""
"If one player wins, his or her allies win too. If one group of allies "
"remains, they win."
msgstr "Jika satu pemain menang, sekutunya juga menang. Jika sebuah kumpulan sekutu tersisa, mereka menang."

